From 55283e774d09f0abe862960ddd12c885cfe74338 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yonglunyao <yonglunyao@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 04:44:26 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] headers: bulk-import generic OH header deltas from rk3568
 board patch

Generic-OH include/ deltas from rk3568_patch/kernel.patch @
OpenHarmony-7.0-Release, pruned to the safe set: additive new headers
(dt-bindings display, memory/priority/protected managers, thermal trace
events, trace/hooks vendor API, v4l2-uvc, videobuf2-cma-sg, dma-buf-cache,
wakeup_reason, version_compat, initramfs) plus modified headers that pair
with pristine code or are config-gated (of_gpio.h pairs with 0017,
sched.h QOS fields gated, core deltas exercised green through build12
rounds 10-11). Dropped after live regressions: drm_edid.h
(-Wreturn-type stub), drm bridge/connector set (dw_hdmi_bind type
conflict vs pristine dw-hdmi.c), media mipi-csi2/v4l2-async (pair with
rockchip camera drivers absent here). Rockchip-specific headers excluded
throughout.
